00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:42.360
and drill into one of the most pressing ongoing challenges in health

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:45.129
for people around the globe, and that's tuberculosis.

00:00:45.129 --> 00:00:46.920
Madhukar, thank you so much for doing this.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.210
I'm really excited that you're here.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.418
